{"study_accession":"PRJNA576899","secondary_study_accession":"SRP225093","title":"CD8+ T cells in peripheral blood lymphocytes and tumor-infiltrating lymphocytes of melanoma patients","description":"CD8+ T cells are the primary target of immune checkpoint inhibitor (ICI) therapy in the treatment of melanoma. ICI therapy only benefits a subset of patients and complicating this issue is a reliable prediction method that does not require invasive biopsies. In the hope of remedying this challenge, we conducted single-cell transcriptomic analyses of CD8+ T cells in peripheral blood lymphocytes (CD8-mPBLs) and, importantly, tumor-infiltrating lymphocytes (CD8-mTILs) from 8 patients with metastatic melanoma. Overall design: CD8+ T cells in peripheral blood lymphocytes and tumor-infiltrating lymphocytes from 8 melanoma patients were sorted and profiled with single-cell RNA sequencing.","pubmed":"34807232","geo_series":"","n_samples":16,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN13012627","study_accession":"PRJNA576899","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"CD8TIL.Pt8","description":"CD8TIL.Pt8","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM4116709","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-11-18","attributes":[["source_name","CD8 T cells from melanoma tumor"],["tissue","tumor"],["cell_type","CD8 T cells"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR10258425","experiment_accession":"SRX6976297","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2500","read_count":268688722,"base_count":26331494756,"first_public":"2021-11-18","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM4116709: CD8TIL.Pt8 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN13012628","study_accession":"PRJNA576899","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"CD8PBL.Pt8","description":"CD8PBL.Pt8","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM4116708","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-11-18","attributes":[["source_name","CD8 T cells from